    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50966" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vincĭbĭlis</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		vinco. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Pass.</i>, <i>that can be easily
				gained</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">causa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Phorm. 1, 4, 48</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
